flowchart TD
    Monitor[Dashboard / ReportView] --> Data[Du lieu chinh]
    Data --> Product[Product / ProductSerial]
    Data --> Stock[StockBalance / StockLedger]
    Data --> Docs[StockIn / StockOut / Transfer / Adjustment]
    Monitor --> Trace[Truy vet]
    Trace --> Audit[AuditLog]
    Trace --> ReportTrace[ReportTraceService]
    Trace --> Ledger[StockLedger timeline]
    Monitor --> Warning[Canh bao]
    Warning --> SerialGap[Serial thieu lien ket]
    Warning --> NegativeStock[Ton am/le ch so]
    Warning --> OpenClaim[Claim chua dong]
